    "steam_appid": 3361540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361540/extras/ec600cae8f9f19bc37fc7f8d466361cb.webp?t=1755121062\" width=620 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyrone was minding his own business, when the cops rolled up with weapons drawn, claiming that they had a warrant for his arrest (again)... It's time to teach those pigs another lesson! This is a rogue-like third person shooter exploring the reality of police brutality in America. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring all new mechanics and a new map, Tyrone is back and blacker than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Tyrone </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold your gun sideways </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot it at cops </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot their weapons after you kill them </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen different types of enemy cops, including BOSS COPS </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken the latent power of your melanin using kills from your past lives </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 different perks and abilities to improve Tyrone's cop-killing capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive assistance from cute Federal Agents</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361540/extras/ec600cae8f9f19bc37fc7f8d466361cb.webp?t=1755121062\" width=620 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyrone was minding his own business, when the cops rolled up with weapons drawn, claiming that they had a warrant for his arrest (again)... It's time to teach those pigs another lesson! This is a rogue-like third person shooter exploring the reality of police brutality in America. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring all new mechanics and a new map, Tyrone is back and blacker than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Tyrone </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold your gun sideways </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot it at cops </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot their weapons after you kill them </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen different types of enemy cops, including BOSS COPS </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken the latent power of your melanin using kills from your past lives </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 different perks and abilities to improve Tyrone's cop-killing capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive assistance from cute Federal Agents</p></li></ul>",
